# Third-party notices

ASTORIA's original material is covered by the root MIT `LICENSE`. The following notices preserve upstream copyrights and permissions for adapted capability instructions. Individual skills retain source citations. Linked software, model weights, datasets and articles remain separate resources with their own terms.

The adaptations integrate source material with ASTORIA's researcher-owned context, evidence checks, routing and organization. Source names below identify the cited projects; they do not imply that their software runtimes are included.

